  "final_message": "The root cause was an early return in `billing/payments.py`\u2019s `collect` function when no payment method existed. It skipped the failure handler, so dunning never started. The function now records a `no_payment_method` failure, which emits the event, schedules retries, and moves the subscription through dunning.\n\nI added a regression test covering retry exhaustion. All 25 tests pass. I also wrote `answer.json` in the repository root.",
